## The Reality of "Withdrawing as Real Cash"
To convert digital system exploits into physical paper money or real bank credit, attackers must bypass Anti-Money Laundering (AML) and Know Your Customer (KYC) compliance triggers. This phase usually relies on financial obfuscation techniques: [36, 37] 

* Money Mules: Using compromised or rented identity profiles to receive bank wires.
* Over-The-Counter (OTC) Brokers: Exchanging stolen digital assets directly for physical cash through unregulated entities.
* Prepaid Cards and Gift Cards: Converting stolen system balances into anonymous retail value assets that can be resold. [38, 39, 40, 41, 42] 

